---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Stress & Burnout Counselling in Kathmandu" 
  description="Overwhelmed, exhausted or burnt out? Confidential stress and burnout counselling in Kathmandu, in person or online, to help you recover and build resilience."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-white pt-16 pb-12 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">Insights & Support</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">Stress Management & Burnout Counselling in Kathmandu</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        Stress is a normal response to pressure. It becomes a problem when it does not let up, and you begin to feel exhausted, tense, irritable or numb. Effective help is about understanding your limits, restoring your energy and building resilience.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-10 text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">Signs that stress has become too much</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Constant tiredness, even after rest</li>
          <li>Trouble sleeping, or sleeping too much</li>
          <li>Headaches, muscle tension or stomach problems</li>
          <li>Irritability, snapping at people, or feeling emotionally flat</li>
          <li>Dread about work, studies or responsibilities</li>
          <li>Withdrawing from friends and family</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">How counselling helps</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">Together we look at where the pressure is coming from, how you currently cope, and what has to change. Therapy may include:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Understanding your stress response and early warning signs</li>
          <li>Practical tools for calming the body and mind</li>
          <li>Challenging unhelpful thinking, for example perfectionism and difficulty saying no</li>
          <li>Setting boundaries and making realistic plans</li>
          <li>Rebuilding routines for sleep, activity and recovery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-8 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#173A7A] focus-visible:outline-none">How do I know if I need counselling, or just a holiday?</summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed pt-3 border-t border-[#f1f5f9]">A break helps when stress comes from temporary overload. If you recover little after rest, or the feelings return quickly, counselling can address the causes.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#173A7A] focus-visible:outline-none">Can therapy help even if I can't change my job or situation?</summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed pt-3 border-t border-[#f1f5f9]">Often yes. Therapy can change how you cope, set limits and make decisions, even when circumstances stay difficult.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">If stress is taking more than it should, you can start with a conversation.</h2>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">Request a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>